   "subject": "Dependencies: What does your package need? package::function()",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">Hey all,</font><div><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">I apologize in advance if this is not the right forum for my question (let me know if you think I should publish this elsewhere). I&#39;m reading the part on <span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);line-height:1.1\">Dependencies: What does your package need? in Hadley&#39;s book on R packages. It says there that if I add a package dependency using import </span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);line-height:20px\">it does </span><em style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);line-height:20px\">not</em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);line-height:20px\"> mean that it will be attached along with your package, and that the </span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);line-height:20px\">best practice is to explicitly refer to external functions using the syntax </span><code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:1px;color:rgb(51,51,51);border-radius:4px;line-height:20px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">package::function()</code><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);line-height:20px\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);line-height:1.1\"> </span></font><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;color:rgb(51,51,51);line-height:1.1\">I know my question is silly but I don&#39;t understand the </span><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;color:rgb(51,51,51);line-height:20px\"> </span><code style=\"padding:1px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);border-radius:4px;line-height:20px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">package::function()</code><code style=\"padding:1px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);border-radius:4px;line-height:20px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"> </code><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;color:rgb(51,51,51);line-height:14.3000001907349px\">part. Can someone please provide me an example of how to implement this in a code? </span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;color:rgb(51,51,51);line-height:14.3000001907349px\"><br></span></div><div><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"line-height:14.3000001907349px\">Any help will be greatly appreciated,</span></font></div><div><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;color:rgb(51,51,51);line-height:14.3000001907349px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;color:rgb(51,51,51);line-height:14.3000001907349px\">Ayala</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;color:rgb(51,51,51);line-height:14.3000001907349px\"><br></span></div><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
